WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:21.559
The air was getting colder.

2
00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:29.689
The days were getting shorter.

3
00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:35.191
Kip was counting his acorns.

4
00:00:35.192 --> 00:00:40.481
"This should be enough," Kip said.

5
00:00:40.482 --> 00:00:43.242
He looked down at Bird.

6
00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:47.359
"I'm really looking forward to winter."

7
00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:49.977
"I'm glad," said Bird.

8
00:00:49.978 --> 00:00:53.030
"You will have lots of fun this winter."

9
00:00:53.031 --> 00:00:55.998
"No," said Kip.

10
00:00:55.999 --> 00:01:00.050
"We will have lots of fun this winter."

11
00:01:00.051 --> 00:01:05.165
"Actually," said Bird. "I wanted to tell you—"

12
00:01:05.166 --> 00:01:08.332
"That you love sledding?" asked Kip.

13
00:01:08.333 --> 00:01:12.157
"No, not that," said Bird.

14
00:01:12.158 --> 00:01:16.523
"That you love ice-skating?" asked Kip.

15
00:01:16.524 --> 00:01:19.948
"Not that either," said Bird.

16
00:01:19.949 --> 00:01:23.152
"Well, what then?" asked Kip.

17
00:01:23.153 --> 00:01:28.294
"I'm flying south for the winter," said Bird.

18
00:01:28.295 --> 00:01:32.766
"You're flying south for the winter?" asked Kip.

19
00:01:32.767 --> 00:01:37.324
"Yes," said Bird. "But don't worry.

20
00:01:37.325 --> 00:01:44.117
I'll be back in the spring."

21
00:01:44.118 --> 00:01:47.916
"Why are you going?" asked Kip.

22
00:01:47.917 --> 00:01:55.671
"Because," said Bird. "It's what birds do."
